From 786c1db2a26a3794dfb98af08bb74dab564fad70 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: anyingiit <49945850+anyingiit@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 16:36:19 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Accept duplicate keys in values files like Helm does

Values files given via the test suite `values:` list or the `--values`
flag were parsed with the strict yaml.v3 decoder, which rejects
duplicated mapping keys. Helm itself accepts such files and lets the
last occurrence win, so charts that render fine with Helm could not be
tested.

Parse values files into a yaml.v3 node tree, drop all but the last
occurrence of every duplicated mapping key and decode the result.

Resolves #848
